meta {
  name: Revoke Other Sessions
  type: http
  seq: 5
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/settings/sessions/logout-others
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

headers {
  Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{authToken}}
}

docs {
  # Revoke Other Sessions
  Revoke all other active login tokens and sessions across other devices.

  ### Authentication
  Bearer Token

  ### Allowed Roles
  - Founder
- Mentor
- Admin

  ### Response Status Codes
  - `200` - All other sessions terminated.
  - `401` - Unauthorized.

  ### Response Example (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "All other active sessions have been logged out."
  }
  ```
}
